OL,3,GNEWSAFraud mastermind whose gang
OL,4,Apocketed #1m is jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday at Southwark Crown Court,
OL,7,Fthe 38-year-old, who had been living in
OL,8,FSingapore but previously had businesses
OL,9,Fin Shenfield, Essex, pleaded guilty to
OL,10,Ffraud, money laundering and perverting
OL,11,Fthe course of justice.
OL,13,FOne of his victims, who invested more
OL,14,Fthan #35,000, said: "The investment was
OL,15,Fsupposed to be our lifeboat, instead it
OL,16,Fwas our Titanic."
